53
00:02:13,102 --> 00:02:15,059
And you find some other pieces of

54
00:02:15,059 --> 00:02:17,336
information here, which you can explore in

55
00:02:17,368 --> 00:02:18,298
greater detail.

56
00:02:19,036 --> 00:02:21,410
Like for example, the default configuration

57
00:02:21,442 --> 00:02:22,741
that's applied to this model.

58
00:02:23,687 --> 00:02:25,623
For example, here a quite high temperature

59
00:02:25,623 --> 00:02:27,365
value for high creativity,

60
00:02:27,962 --> 00:02:29,947
but we'll get back to configuring these

61
00:02:29,963 --> 00:02:32,125
models and creating your own customized

